fallbacks.json

# session measurement harnesses, written to the repo root by hand while sizing
# a class (before/after probes, store diffs, a copy of app.js under test). They
# are working files, not deliverables: throwaway per cycle, and app.js.bak alone
# is 268KB, so committing them would grow history for nothing — this repo was
# squashed once already to drop large blobs.
#
# A harness that is worth KEEPING does not belong here either: the rule this
# record arrived at the hard way is that it becomes a named test under
# scripts/ (merge-name-test.mjs, generic-typo-test.mjs), because a container
# restart wipes everything else. scratchpad/apppath.mjs — which slices app.js's
# own body so a measurement goes through the function the page calls — has now
# been rebuilt twice after exactly that, and promoting it is QUEUED rather than
# done here: scripts/** is a build-data trigger path and a run is in flight.
scratchpad/
